esolved satisfactorily, and I would like to know the next steps for escalation. Please advise.\n\nRegards,\nRobert</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Email Without Unwanted Texts:</b><br>From:    Robert Lee <robert.lee@example.com>\nSent:    Thursday, May 29, 2024 1:45 PM\nTo:      Customer Service <service@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: Re: Issue with Last Service\n\nHello,\n\nI am following up on my last service request. The issue was not resolved satisfactorily, and I would like to know the next steps for escalation. Please advise.\n\nRegards,\nRobert</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Processed Email:</b><br>from robert lee sent thursday may pm to customer service service subject re issue last service hello following last service request the issue resolved satisfactorily would like know next step escalation please advise regards robert</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </table>\n                    '}, 'metadata': {}}]}, 'buffer_paths': []}}, 'buffers': []})
