2024-06-24 18:34:22,344 - DEBUG - handle_msg[67de5799cfff47f79f32b49c38889cc1]({'header': {'date': datetime.datetime(2024, 6, 24, 23, 34, 22, 342000, tzinfo=tzutc()), 'msg_id': '38be479d-f814-479c-9fe0-8333eaec745a', 'msg_type': 'comm_msg', 'session': '6c05d9bb-a5ac-4cc6-a92b-e50f3548d7cb', 'username': 'e3e87b61-2680-4d1e-8b7a-d563ba12dd76', 'version': '5.2'}, 'msg_id': '38be479d-f814-479c-9fe0-8333eaec745a', 'msg_type': 'comm_msg', 'parent_header': {}, 'metadata': {}, 'content': {'comm_id': '67de5799cfff47f79f32b49c38889cc1', 'data': {'method': 'update', 'state': {'outputs': [{'output_type': 'display_data', 'data': {'text/plain': '<IPython.core.display.HTML object>', 'text/html': '\n                    <style>\n                        .email-view {\n                            width: 32%;\n                            overflow-wrap: break-word;\n                            white-space: pre-wrap;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            padding: 10px;\n                        }\n                        table {\n                            width: 100%;\n                            table-layout: fixed;\n                            border-collapse: collapse;\n                        }\n                        td {\n                            vertical-align: top;\n                            border: 1px solid #ccc;\n                        }\n                        mark {\n                            background-color: yellow;\n                            font-weight: bold;\n                        }\n                    </style>\n                    <table>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Original Email (with highlights):</b><br>From:    Sarah Mendez <sarah.mendez@businessdomain.com>\nSent:    Tuesday, June 3, 2024 2:10 PM\nTo:      Customer Service Team <service.team@businessdomain.com>\nCc:      Management Team <management@businessdomain.com>\nBcc:     Compliance <compliance@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: Fwd: <mark style=\'background-color: red;\'>Complaint Regarding Discount Application </mark>- Case #3342\nAttachments: DiscountIssue_Screenshot.png, CustomerEmailThread.pdf\n\nTeam,\n\nAttached are the details and prior communications regarding the ongoing issue faced by customer Alex Ramirez, where the promised discount was not applied to his purchase despite meeting all the criteria mentioned under our current promotion.\n\nPlease review the attached email thread and screenshots, and let\'s discuss how we can address this systematically to prevent future occurrences. We need a strategy meeting to refine our discount application process.\n\nLooking forward to your inputs.\n\nBest,\nSarah</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Email Without Unwanted Texts:</b><br>From:    Sarah Mendez <sarah.mendez@businessdomain.com>\nSent:    Tuesday, June 3, 2024 2:10 PM\nTo:      Customer Service Team <service.team@businessdomain.com>\nCc:      Management Team <management@businessdomain.com>\nBcc:     Compliance <compliance@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: Fwd: - Case #3342\nAttachments: DiscountIssue_Screenshot.png, CustomerEmailThread.pdf\n\nTeam,\n\nAttached are the details and prior communications regarding the ongoing issue faced by customer Alex Ramirez, where the promised discount was not applied to his purchase despite meeting all the criteria mentioned under our current promotion.\n\nPlease review the attached email thread and screenshots, and let\'s discuss how we can address this systematically to prevent future occurrences. We need a strategy meeting to refine our discount application process.\n\nLooking forward to your inputs.\n\nBest,\nSarah</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Processed Email:</b><br>from sarah mendez sent tuesday june pm to customer service team cc management team management bcc compliance compliance subject fwd case attachments team attached detail prior communication regarding ongoing issue faced customer alex ramirez promised discount applied purchase despite meeting criterion mentioned current promotion please review attached email thread screenshots let discus address systematically prevent future occurrence we need strategy meeting refine discount application process looking forward input best sarah</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </table>\n                    '}, 'metadata': {}}]}, 'buffer_paths': []}}, 'buffers': []})
