2024-06-24 18:34:50,329 - DEBUG - handle_msg[67de5799cfff47f79f32b49c38889cc1]({'header': {'date': datetime.datetime(2024, 6, 24, 23, 34, 50, 326000, tzinfo=tzutc()), 'msg_id': '6eb85370-3c10-4616-b54c-167f2f2c4bcb', 'msg_type': 'comm_msg', 'session': '6c05d9bb-a5ac-4cc6-a92b-e50f3548d7cb', 'username': 'e3e87b61-2680-4d1e-8b7a-d563ba12dd76', 'version': '5.2'}, 'msg_id': '6eb85370-3c10-4616-b54c-167f2f2c4bcb', 'msg_type': 'comm_msg', 'parent_header': {}, 'metadata': {}, 'content': {'comm_id': '67de5799cfff47f79f32b49c38889cc1', 'data': {'method': 'update', 'state': {'outputs': [{'output_type': 'display_data', 'data': {'text/plain': '<IPython.core.display.HTML object>', 'text/html': '\n                    <style>\n                        .email-view {\n                            width: 32%;\n                            overflow-wrap: break-word;\n                            white-space: pre-wrap;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            padding: 10px;\n                        }\n                        table {\n                            width: 100%;\n                            table-layout: fixed;\n                            border-collapse: collapse;\n                        }\n                        td {\n                            vertical-align: top;\n                            border: 1px solid #ccc;\n                        }\n                        mark {\n                            background-color: yellow;\n                            font-weight: bold;\n                        }\n                    </style>\n                    <table>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Original Email (with highlights):</b><br>From:    Carrie Preston <c.preston@email.com>\nSent:    Sunday, June 8, 2024 10:14 AM\nTo:      Customer Support <support@ecommerce.com>\nSubject: Unacceptable Condition of Delivered Package\n\nDear Support Team,\n\nI am utterly dismayed and angered by the condition of the package I received this morning. The items I ordered were not only broken but shattered into pieces, rendering them completely useless. This is absolutely unacceptable!\n\nI demand a full refund and compensation for the damage. I expect a prompt response and resolution to this matter, or I will be forced to take further actions, including legal recourse and public reviews detailing my horrific experience.\n\nSincerely,\nCarrie Preston\n\n--- On Sun, 6/8/24, Sarah Jennings <s.jennings@ecommerce.com> wrote:\n\nFrom: Sarah Jennings <s.jennings@ecommerce.com>\nSubject: Fwd: Unacceptable Condition of Delivered Package\nTo: Regional Manager <rm@ecommerce.com>\nCc: Legal Department <legal@ecommerce.com>\nSent: Sunday, June 8, 2024 10:45 AM\n\nHi,\n\nPlease see the email below from a customer regarding a damaged delivery. This seems serious, and she is threatening legal action. Can we discuss how to handle this? We may need to involve Legal.\n\nThanks,\nSarah\n\n--- On Sun, 6/8/24, Regional Manager <rm@ecommerce.com> replied:\n\nFrom: Regional Manager <rm@ecommerce.com>\nSubject: Re: Fwd: Unacceptable Condition of Delivered Package\nTo: Quality Assurance <qa@ecommerce.com>\nCc: Sarah Jennings <s.jennings@ecommerce.com>, Legal Department <legal@ecommerce.com>\nSent: Sunday, June 8, 2024 11:30 AM\n\nQA Team,\n\nCan we get an urgent check on what might have gone wrong with the shipment to Ms. Preston? We need to ensure this is an isolated incident.\n\nRegards,\n[Regional Manager\'s Name]\n\n--- On Sun, 6/8/24, Quality Assurance <qa@ecommerce.com> replied:\n\nFrom: Quality Assurance <qa@ecommerce.com>\nSubject: Re: Re: Fwd: Unacceptable Condition of Delivered Package\nTo: Distribution Center Manager <dcm@ecommerce.com>\nCc: Regional Manager <rm@ecommerce.com>, Sarah Jennings <s.jennings@ecommerce.com>\nSent: Sunday, June 8, 2024 12:00 PM\n\nDC Manager,\n\nWe need an immediate investigation into the handling procedures for outgoing packages, particularly for the batch including Ms. Preston\'s order. Please report back ASAP.\n\nThank you,\nQA Lead\n\n--- On Sun, 6/8/24, Distribution Center Manager <dcm@ecommerce.com> wrote:\n\nFrom: Distribution Center Manager <dcm@ecommerce.com>\nSubject: Re: Re: Re: Fwd: Unacceptable Condition of Delivered Package\nTo: Quality Assurance <qa@ecommerce.com>\nCc: Regional Manager <rm@ecommerce.com>, Sarah Jennings <s.jennings@ecommerce.com>\nSent: Sunday, June 8, 2024 1:15 PM\n\nQA Team,\n\nPreliminary review suggests a failure in our packing process for fragile items. We are conducting a full audit and will implement immediate corrections. Detailed report to follow by tomorrow.\n\nBest,\n[DC Manager\'s Name]\n</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Email Without Unwanted Texts:</b><br>From:    Carrie Preston <c.preston@email.com>\nSent:    Sunday, June 8, 2024 10:14 AM\nTo:      Customer Support <support@ecommerce.com>\nSubject: Unacceptable Condition of Delivered Package\n\nDear Support Team,\n\nI am utterly dismayed and angered by the condition of the package I received this morning. The items I ordered were not only broken but shattered into pieces, rendering them completely useless. This is absolutely unacceptable!\n\nI demand a full refund and compensation for the damage. I expect a prompt response and resolution to this matter, or I will be forced to take further actions, including legal recourse and public reviews detailing my horrific experience.\n\nSincerely,\nCarrie Preston\n\n--- On Sun, 6/8/24, Sarah Jennings <s.jennings@ecommerce.com> wrote:\n\nFrom: Sarah Jennings <s.jennings@ecommerce.com>\nSubject: Fwd: Unacceptable Condition of Delivered Package\nTo: Regional Manager <rm@ecommerce.com>\nCc: Legal Department <legal@ecommerce.com>\nSent: Sunday, June 8, 2024 10:45 AM\n\nHi,\n\nPlease see the email below from a customer regarding a damaged delivery. This seems serious, and she is threatening legal action. Can we discuss how to handle this? We may need to involve Legal.\n\nThanks,\nSarah\n\n--- On Sun, 6/8/24, Regional Manager <rm@ecommerce.com> replied:\n\nFrom: Regional Manager <rm@ecommerce.com>\nSubject: Re: Fwd: Unacceptable Condition of Delivered Package\nTo: Quality Assurance <qa@ecommerce.com>\nCc: Sarah Jennings <s.jennings@ecommerce.com>, Legal Department <legal@ecommerce.com>\nSent: Sunday, June 8, 2024 11:30 AM\n\nQA Team,\n\nCan we get an urgent check on what might have gone wrong with the shipment to Ms. Preston? We need to ensure this is an isolated incident.\n\nRegards,\n[Regional Manager\'s Name]\n\n--- On Sun, 6/8/24, Quality Assurance <qa@ecommerce.com> replied:\n\nFrom: Quality Assurance <qa@ecommerce.com>\nSubject: Re: Re: Fwd: Unacceptable Condition of Delivered Package\nTo: Distribution Center Manager <dcm@ecommerce.com>\nCc: Regional Manager <rm@ecommerce.com>, Sarah Jennings <s.jennings@ecommerce.com>\nSent: Sunday, June 8, 2024 12:00 PM\n\nDC Manager,\n\nWe need an immediate investigation into the handling procedures for outgoing packages, particularly for the batch including Ms. Preston\'s order. Please report back ASAP.\n\nThank you,\nQA Lead\n\n--- On Sun, 6/8/24, Distribution Center Manager <dcm@ecommerce.com> wrote:\n\nFrom: Distribution Center Manager <dcm@ecommerce.com>\nSubject: Re: Re: Re: Fwd: Unacceptable Condition of Delivered Package\nTo: Quality Assurance <qa@ecommerce.com>\nCc: Regional Manager <rm@ecommerce.com>, Sarah Jennings <s.jennings@ecommerce.com>\nSent: Sunday, June 8, 2024 1:15 PM\n\nQA Team,\n\nPreliminary review suggests a failure in our packing process for fragile items. We are conducting a full audit and will implement immediate corrections. Detailed report to follow by tomorrow.\n\nBest,\n[DC Manager\'s Name]\n</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Processed Email:</b><br>from carrie preston sent sunday june am to customer support support subject unacceptable condition delivered package dear support team utterly dismayed angered condition package received morning the item ordered broken shattered piece rendering completely useless this absolutely unacceptable demand full refund compensation damage expect prompt response resolution matter forced take action including legal recourse public review detailing horrific experience sincerely carrie preston on sun sarah jennings wrote from sarah jennings subject fwd unacceptable condition delivered package to regional manager rm cc legal department legal sent sunday june am hi please see email customer regarding damaged delivery this seems serious threatening legal action can discus handle we may need involve legal thanks sarah on sun regional manager rm replied from regional manager rm subject re fwd unacceptable condition delivered package to quality assurance qa cc sarah jennings legal department legal sent sunday june am qa team can get urgent check might gone wrong shipment preston we need ensure isolated incident regards regional manager name on sun quality assurance qa replied from quality assurance qa subject re re fwd unacceptable condition delivered package to distribution center manager dcm cc regional manager rm sarah jennings sent sunday june pm dc manager we need immediate investigation handling procedure outgoing package particularly batch including preston order please report back asap thank qa lead on sun distribution center manager dcm wrote from distribution center manager dcm subject re re re fwd unacceptable condition delivered package to quality assurance qa cc regional manager rm sarah jennings sent sunday june pm qa team preliminary review suggests failure packing process fragile item we conducting full audit implement immediate correction detailed report follow tomorrow best dc manager name</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </table>\n                    '}, 'metadata': {}}]}, 'buffer_paths': []}}, 'buffers': []})
