ncials.xlsx\nCategories: Finance\n\nTeam,\n\nPlease review the attached Q3 financials ahead of our audit next week. We need to ensure all entries are accurate and backed by appropriate documentation. External auditors are cc’d here for their preliminary assessments.\n\nRegards,\nDavid</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Email Without Unwanted Texts:</b><br>From: David Choi <david.choi@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Wednesday, July 16, 2024 2:45 PM\nTo: Finance Department <finance@businessdomain.com>\nCc: External Auditors <auditors@auditfirm.com>\nSubject: Urgent: Q3 Financial Audit Documents\nAttachments: Q3_Financials.xlsx\nCategories: Finance\n\nTeam,\n\nPlease review the attached Q3 financials ahead of our audit next week. We need to ensure all entries are accurate and backed by appropriate documentation. External auditors are cc’d here for their preliminary assessments.\n\nRegards,\nDavid</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Processed Email:</b><br>from david choi sent wednesday july pm to finance department finance cc external auditors auditor subject urgent financial audit documents attachments categories finance team please review attached financials ahead audit next week we need ensure entry accurate backed appropriate documentation external auditor cc preliminary assessment regards david</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </table>\n                    '}, 'metadata': {}}]}, 'buffer_paths': []}}, 'buffers': []})
