2024-06-24 18:34:55,393 - DEBUG - handle_msg[67de5799cfff47f79f32b49c38889cc1]({'header': {'date': datetime.datetime(2024, 6, 24, 23, 34, 55, 391000, tzinfo=tzutc()), 'msg_id': 'd2d9d646-c77e-421e-99ef-c1d3d4ed5917', 'msg_type': 'comm_msg', 'session': '6c05d9bb-a5ac-4cc6-a92b-e50f3548d7cb', 'username': 'e3e87b61-2680-4d1e-8b7a-d563ba12dd76', 'version': '5.2'}, 'msg_id': 'd2d9d646-c77e-421e-99ef-c1d3d4ed5917', 'msg_type': 'comm_msg', 'parent_header': {}, 'metadata': {}, 'content': {'comm_id': '67de5799cfff47f79f32b49c38889cc1', 'data': {'method': 'update', 'state': {'outputs': [{'output_type': 'display_data', 'data': {'text/plain': '<IPython.core.display.HTML object>', 'text/html': '\n                    <style>\n                        .email-view {\n                            width: 32%;\n                            overflow-wrap: break-word;\n                            white-space: pre-wrap;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            padding: 10px;\n                        }\n                        table {\n                            width: 100%;\n                            table-layout: fixed;\n                            border-collapse: collapse;\n                        }\n                        td {\n                            vertical-align: top;\n                            border: 1px solid #ccc;\n                        }\n                        mark {\n                            background-color: yellow;\n                            font-weight: bold;\n                        }\n                    </style>\n                    <table>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Original Email (with highlights):</b><br>From: Lisa Wong <lisa.wong@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Tuesday, August 5, 2024 1:00 PM\nTo:<mark style=\'background-color: red;\'> IT Support </mark>Team <itsupport@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: Scheduled System Upgrade\nAttachments: System_Upgrade_Notification_08_2024.pdf\nCategories: IT Announcements\n\nHi Team,\n\nPlease be reminded of the scheduled system upgrade this Friday as detailed in the attached document. Ensure that all systems are backed up accordingly.\n\nBest,\nLisa\n\n--- On Tue, Aug 5, 2024 at 1:45 PM, Tom Black <tom.black@businessdomain.com> wrote:\nFrom: Tom Black <tom.black@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: RE: Scheduled System Upgrade\nTo: Lisa Wong <lisa.wong@businessdomain.com>\nCc: Department Heads <dept.heads@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Tuesday, August 5, 2024 1:45 PM\n\nLisa,\n\nHas the security team confirmed that all new patches have been tested? It’s crucial we avoid last-minute issues that could affect productivity.\n\nRegards,\nTom\n\n--- On Tue, Aug 5, 2024 at 2:10 PM, Security Team <security@businessdomain.com> wrote:\nFrom: Security Team <security@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: RE: Scheduled System Upgrade\nTo: Tom Black <tom.black@businessdomain.com>, Lisa Wong <lisa.wong@businessdomain.com>\nCc: Department Heads <dept.heads@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Tuesday, August 5, 2024 2:10 PM\n\nTom, Lisa,\n\nAll patches have been tested and are ready for deployment. We will have additional support on standby during the upgrade process.\n\nCheers,\nNancy Heart\nSecurity Team Lead</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Email Without Unwanted Texts:</b><br>From: Lisa Wong <lisa.wong@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Tuesday, August 5, 2024 1:00 PM\nTo:Team <itsupport@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: Scheduled System Upgrade\nAttachments: System_Upgrade_Notification_08_2024.pdf\nCategories: IT Announcements\n\nHi Team,\n\nPlease be reminded of the scheduled system upgrade this Friday as detailed in the attached document. Ensure that all systems are backed up accordingly.\n\nBest,\nLisa\n\n--- On Tue, Aug 5, 2024 at 1:45 PM, Tom Black <tom.black@businessdomain.com> wrote:\nFrom: Tom Black <tom.black@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: RE: Scheduled System Upgrade\nTo: Lisa Wong <lisa.wong@businessdomain.com>\nCc: Department Heads <dept.heads@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Tuesday, August 5, 2024 1:45 PM\n\nLisa,\n\nHas the security team confirmed that all new patches have been tested? It’s crucial we avoid last-minute issues that could affect productivity.\n\nRegards,\nTom\n\n--- On Tue, Aug 5, 2024 at 2:10 PM, Security Team <security@businessdomain.com> wrote:\nFrom: Security Team <security@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: RE: Scheduled System Upgrade\nTo: Tom Black <tom.black@businessdomain.com>, Lisa Wong <lisa.wong@businessdomain.com>\nCc: Department Heads <dept.heads@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Tuesday, August 5, 2024 2:10 PM\n\nTom, Lisa,\n\nAll patches have been tested and are ready for deployment. We will have additional support on standby during the upgrade process.\n\nCheers,\nNancy Heart\nSecurity Team Lead</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Processed Email:</b><br>from lisa wong sent tuesday august pm to team itsupport subject scheduled system upgrade attachments categories it announcements hi team please reminded scheduled system upgrade friday detailed attached document ensure system backed accordingly best lisa on tue aug pm tom black wrote from tom black subject re scheduled system upgrade to lisa wong cc department heads sent tuesday august pm lisa has security team confirmed new patch tested it crucial avoid issue could affect productivity regards tom on tue aug pm security team security wrote from security team security subject re scheduled system upgrade to tom black lisa wong cc department heads sent tuesday august pm tom lisa all patch tested ready deployment we additional support standby upgrade process cheers nancy heart security team lead</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </table>\n                    '}, 'metadata': {}}]}, 'buffer_paths': []}}, 'buffers': []})
2024-06-24 18:34:55,897 - DEBUG - handle_msg[2da281cd4fa74430b8c2c54fd56555c4]({'header': {'date': datetime.datetime(2024, 6, 24, 23, 34, 55, 893000, tzinfo=tzutc()), 'msg_id': '4400fecc-7a28-4701-93c8-590d324a69a3', 'msg_type': 'comm_msg', 'session': '6c05d9bb-a5ac-4cc6-a92b-e50f3548d7cb', 'username': 'e3e87b61-2680-4d1e-8b7a-d563ba12dd76', 'version': '5.2'}, 'msg_id': '4400fecc-7a28-4701-93c8-590d324a69a3', 'msg_type': 'comm_msg', 'parent_header': {}, 'metadata': {}, 'content': {'comm_id': '2da281cd4fa74430b8c2c54fd56555c4', 'data': {'method': 'custom', 'content': {'event': 'click'}}}, 'buffers': []})
2024-06-24 18:34:55,929 - DEBUG - handle_msg[67de5799cfff47f79f32b49c38889cc1]({'header': {'date': datetime.datetime(2024, 6, 24, 23, 34, 55, 925000, tzinfo=tzutc()), 'msg_id': '4a331e55-2218-481b-8c39-1c7a0cf5bb04', 'msg_type': 'comm_msg', 'session': '6c05d9bb-a5ac-4cc6-a92b-e50f3548d7cb', 'username': 'e3e87b61-2680-4d1e-8b7a-d563ba12dd76', 'version': '5.2'}, 'msg_id': '4a331e55-2218-481b-8c39-1c7a0cf5bb04', 'msg_type': 'comm_msg', 'parent_header': {}, 'metadata': {}, 'content': {'comm_id': '67de5799cfff47f79f32b49c38889cc1', 'data': {'method': 'update', 'state': {'outputs': [{'output_type': 'display_data', 'data': {'text/plain': '<IPython.core.display.HTML object>', 'text/html': '\n                    <style>\n                        .email-view {\n                            width: 32%;\n                            overflow-wrap: break-word;\n                            white-space: pre-wrap;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            padding: 10px;\n                        }\n                        table {\n                            width: 100%;\n                            table-layout: fixed;\n                            border-collapse: collapse;\n                        }\n                        td {\n                            vertical-align: top;\n                            border: 1px solid #ccc;\n                        }\n                        mark {\n                            background-color: yellow;\n                            font-weight: bold;\n                        }\n                    </style>\n                    <table>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Original Email (with highlights):</b><br>From: Nancy Reed <nancy.reed@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Monday, September 15, 2024 10:00 AM\nTo: Sales Team <sales@businessdomain.com>\nCc: Client Services <clientservices@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: Client Feedback on Recent Product Launch\nAttachments: Client_Feedback_Report_September_2024.pdf\nCategories: Client Feedback\n\nDear Team,\n\nAttached you will find the client feedback report for our recent product launch. Please review and prepare any necessary response strategies for our meeting tomorrow.\n\nRegards,\nNancy\n\n--- On Mon, Sep 15, 2024 at 10:30 AM, Derek Lee <derek.lee@businessdomain.com> wrote:\nFrom: Derek Lee <derek.lee@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: RE: Client Feedback on Recent Product Launch\nTo: Nancy Reed <nancy.reed@businessdomain.com>\nCc: Client Services <clientservices@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Monday, September 15, 2024 10:30 AM\n\nNancy,\n\nThe feedback highlights several areas for improvement, especially in customer support during the launch phase. Should we schedule a separate session to address these concerns more thoroughly?\n\nBest,\nDerek\n\n--- On Mon, Sep 15, 2024 at 11:00 AM, Client Services <clientservices@businessdomain.com> wrote:\nFrom: Client Services <clientservices@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: RE: Client Feedback on Recent Product Launch\nTo: Derek Lee <derek.lee@businessdomain.com>, Nancy Reed <nancy.reed@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Monday, September 15, 2024 11:00 AM\n\nDerek, Nancy,\n\nAgreed. A focused discussion on enhancing our support framework would be beneficial. I’ve attached an initial proposal for improvements based on the feedback.\nAttachments: Support_Improvement_Proposal_2024.pdf\n\nRegards,\nBob Smithers\nClient Services Manager</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Email Without Unwanted Texts:</b><br>From: Nancy Reed <nancy.reed@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Monday, September 15, 2024 10:00 AM\nTo: Sales Team <sales@businessdomain.com>\nCc: Client Services <clientservices@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: Client Feedback on Recent Product Launch\nAttachments: Client_Feedback_Report_September_2024.pdf\nCategories: Client Feedback\n\nDear Team,\n\nAttached you will find the client feedback report for our recent product launch. Please review and prepare any necessary response strategies for our meeting tomorrow.\n\nRegards,\nNancy\n\n--- On Mon, Sep 15, 2024 at 10:30 AM, Derek Lee <derek.lee@businessdomain.com> wrote:\nFrom: Derek Lee <derek.lee@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: RE: Client Feedback on Recent Product Launch\nTo: Nancy Reed <nancy.reed@businessdomain.com>\nCc: Client Services <clientservices@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Monday, September 15, 2024 10:30 AM\n\nNancy,\n\nThe feedback highlights several areas for improvement, especially in customer support during the launch phase. Should we schedule a separate session to address these concerns more thoroughly?\n\nBest,\nDerek\n\n--- On Mon, Sep 15, 2024 at 11:00 AM, Client Services <clientservices@businessdomain.com> wrote:\nFrom: Client Services <clientservices@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: RE: Client Feedback on Recent Product Launch\nTo: Derek Lee <derek.lee@businessdomain.com>, Nancy Reed <nancy.reed@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Monday, September 15, 2024 11:00 AM\n\nDerek, Nancy,\n\nAgreed. A focused discussion on enhancing our support framework would be beneficial. I’ve attached an initial proposal for improvements based on the feedback.\nAttachments: Support_Improvement_Proposal_2024.pdf\n\nRegards,\nBob Smithers\nClient Services Manager</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Processed Email:</b><br>from nancy reed sent monday september am to sales team sale cc client services clientservices subject client feedback recent product launch attachments categories client feedback dear team attached find client feedback report recent product launch please review prepare necessary response strategy meeting tomorrow regards nancy on mon sep am derek lee wrote from derek lee subject re client feedback recent product launch to nancy reed cc client services clientservices sent monday september am nancy the feedback highlight several area improvement especially customer support launch phase should schedule separate session address concern thoroughly best derek on mon sep am client services clientservices wrote from client services clientservices subject re client feedback recent product launch to derek lee nancy reed sent monday september am derek nancy agreed focused discussion enhancing support framework would beneficial attached initial proposal improvement based feedback attachments regards bob smithers client services manager</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </table>\n                    '}, 'metadata': {}}]}, 'buffer_paths': []}}, 'buffers': []})
