ts\n\nDear Team,\n\nAs we close this quarter, it\'s critical that we reconcile our budgets promptly. I\'ve attached the Q3 Budget Report. Please review and provide your updates by EOD Thursday.\n\nBest regards,\nMichael Chen\n\n--- On Wed, Oct 1, 2024 at 9:30 AM, Sarah Gibson <sarah.gibson@financecorp.com> wrote:\nFrom: Sarah Gibson <sarah.gibson@financecorp.com>\nSubject: RE: Urgent: Budget Reconciliation Needed\nTo: Michael Chen <michael.chen@financecorp.com>\nCc: Finance Department <finance@financecorp.com>\nSent: Wednesday, October 1, 2024 9:30 AM\n\nMichael,\n\nNoted on the urgency. I noticed a discrepancy in the marketing budget section. Shall we discuss this afternoon?\n\nCheers,\nSarah</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Email Without Unwanted Texts:</b><br>From: Michael Chen <michael.chen@financecorp.com>\nSent: Wednesday, October 1, 2024 9:00 AM\nTo: Finance Department <finance@financecorp.com>\nSubject: Urgent: Budget Reconciliation Needed\nAttachments: Q3_Budget_Report_2024.xlsx\nCategories: Financial Reports\n\nDear Team,\n\nAs we close this quarter, it\'s critical that we reconcile our budgets promptly. I\'ve attached the Q3 Budget Report. Please review and provide your updates by EOD Thursday.\n\nBest regards,\nMichael Chen\n\n--- On Wed, Oct 1, 2024 at 9:30 AM, Sarah Gibson <sarah.gibson@financecorp.com> wrote:\nFrom: Sarah Gibson <sarah.gibson@financecorp.com>\nSubject: RE: Urgent: Budget Reconciliation Needed\nTo: Michael Chen <michael.chen@financecorp.com>\nCc: Finance Department <finance@financecorp.com>\nSent: Wednesday, October 1, 2024 9:30 AM\n\nMichael,\n\nNoted on the urgency. I noticed a discrepancy in the marketing budget section. Shall we discuss this afternoon?\n\nCheers,\nSarah</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Processed Email:</b><br>from michael chen sent wednesday october am to finance department finance subject urgent budget reconciliation needed attachments categories financial reports dear team as close quarter critical reconcile budget promptly attached budget report please review provide update eod thursday best regard michael chen on wed oct am sarah gibson wrote from sarah gibson subject re urgent budget reconciliation needed to michael chen cc finance department finance sent wednesday october am michael noted urgency noticed discrepancy marketing budget section shall discus afternoon cheers sarah</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </table>\n                    '}, 'metadata': {}}]}, 'buffer_paths': []}}, 'buffers': []})
