tion.\n\nBest,\nJohn</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Processed Email:</b><br>from emily turner sent friday november pm to it procurement procurement cc legal department legal subject action required software license renewal approaching attachments categories legal compliance hi team please see attached documentation upcoming renewal software license we need ensure compliance address potential legal issue proceeding thank emily turner on fri nov pm john carter wrote from john carter subject re action required software license renewal approaching to emily turner cc it procurement procurement legal department legal sent friday november pm emily reviewed license suggest meet legal first thing monday discus term negotiation best john</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </table>\n                    '}, 'metadata': {}}]}, 'buffer_paths': []}}, 'buffers': []})
