ject_Sapphire_Update_Week2.pptx\nCategories: Project Updates\n\nHi Team,\n\nPlease find attached the Week 2 update for Project Sapphire. Highlights include client feedback from our last presentation and the revised timeline for the next phase. Let\'s discuss this in today\'s stand-up.\n\nBest,\nLaura\n\n--- On Tue, Jan 14, 2025 at 12:00 PM, David Peterson <david.peterson@creativeagency.com> wrote:\nFrom: David Peterson <david.peterson@creativeagency.com>\nSubject: RE: Weekly Update: Project Sapphire\nTo: Laura Bell <laura.bell@creativeagency.com>\nCc: Project Team <projectteam@creativeagency.com>, Client Services <clientservices@creativeagency.com>\nSent: Tuesday, January 14, 2025 12:00 PM\n\nLaura,\n\nReviewed the update. There are some concerns regarding the revised deadlines. Can we expedite some tasks to stay on track?\n\nThanks,\nDavid</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Email Without Unwanted Texts:</b><br>From: Laura Bell <laura.bell@creativeagency.com>\nSent: Tuesday, January 14, 2025 11:30 AM\nTo: Project Team <projectteam@creativeagency.com>\nCc: Client Services <clientservices@creativeagency.com>\nSubject: Weekly Update: Project Sapphire\nAttachments: Project_Sapphire_Update_Week2.pptx\nCategories: Project Updates\n\nHi Team,\n\nPlease find attached the Week 2 update for Project Sapphire. Highlights include client feedback from our last presentation and the revised timeline for the next phase. Let\'s discuss this in today\'s stand-up.\n\nBest,\nLaura\n\n--- On Tue, Jan 14, 2025 at 12:00 PM, David Peterson <david.peterson@creativeagency.com> wrote:\nFrom: David Peterson <david.peterson@creativeagency.com>\nSubject: RE: Weekly Update: Project Sapphire\nTo: Laura Bell <laura.bell@creativeagency.com>\nCc: Project Team <projectteam@creativeagency.com>, Client Services <clientservices@creativeagency.com>\nSent: Tuesday, January 14, 2025 12:00 PM\n\nLaura,\n\nReviewed the update. There are some concerns regarding the revised deadlines. Ca