2024-06-24 18:35:06,704 - DEBUG - handle_msg[67de5799cfff47f79f32b49c38889cc1]({'header': {'date': datetime.datetime(2024, 6, 24, 23, 35, 6, 702000, tzinfo=tzutc()), 'msg_id': 'da40612e-3a52-4029-a0fe-018442e2698a', 'msg_type': 'comm_msg', 'session': '6c05d9bb-a5ac-4cc6-a92b-e50f3548d7cb', 'username': 'e3e87b61-2680-4d1e-8b7a-d563ba12dd76', 'version': '5.2'}, 'msg_id': 'da40612e-3a52-4029-a0fe-018442e2698a', 'msg_type': 'comm_msg', 'parent_header': {}, 'metadata': {}, 'content': {'comm_id': '67de5799cfff47f79f32b49c38889cc1', 'data': {'method': 'update', 'state': {'outputs': [{'output_type': 'display_data', 'data': {'text/plain': '<IPython.core.display.HTML object>', 'text/html': '\n                    <style>\n                        .email-view {\n                            width: 32%;\n                            overflow-wrap: break-word;\n                            white-space: pre-wrap;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            padding: 10px;\n                        }\n                        table {\n                            width: 100%;\n                            table-layout: fixed;\n                            border-collapse: collapse;\n                        }\n                        td {\n                            vertical-align: top;\n                            border: 1px solid #ccc;\n                        }\n                        mark {\n                            background-color: yellow;\n                            font-weight: bold;\n                        }\n                    </style>\n                    <table>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Original Email (with highlights):</b><br>From: Nancy Reed <nancy.reed@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Monday, September 15, 2024 10:00 AM\nTo: Sales Team <sales@businessdomain.com>\nCc: Client Services <clientservices@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: Client Feedback on Recent Product Launch\nAttachments: Client_Feedback_Report_September_2024.pdf\nCategories: Client Feedback\n\nDear Team,\n\nAttached you will find the client feedback report for our recent product launch. Please review and prepare any necessary response strategies for our meeting tomorrow.\n\nRegards,\nNancy\n\n--- On Mon, Sep 15, 2024 at 10:30 AM, Derek Lee <derek.lee@businessdomain.com> wrote:\nFrom: Derek Lee <derek.lee@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: RE: Client Feedback on Recent Product Launch\nTo: Nancy Reed <nancy.reed@businessdomain.com>\nCc: Client Services <clientservices@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Monday, September 15, 2024 10:30 AM\n\nNancy,\n\nThe feedback highlights several areas for improvement, especially in customer support during the launch phase. Should we schedule a separate session to address these concerns more thoroughly?\n\nBest,\nDerek\n\n--- On Mon, Sep 15, 2024 at 11:00 AM, Client Services <clientservices@businessdomain.com> wrote:\nFrom: Client Services <clientservices@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: RE: Client Feedback on Recent Product Launch\nTo: Derek Lee <derek.lee@businessdomain.com>, Nancy Reed <nancy.reed@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Monday, September 15, 2024 11:00 AM\n\nDerek, Nancy,\n\nAgreed. A focused discussion on enhancing our support framework would be beneficial. I’ve attached an initial proposal for improvements based on the feedback.\nAttachments: Support_Improvement_Proposal_2024.pdf\n\nRegards,\nBob Smithers\nClient Services Manager</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Email Without Unwanted Texts:</b><br>From: Nancy Reed <nancy.reed@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Monday, September 15, 2024 10:00 AM\nTo: Sales Team <sales@businessdomain.com>\nCc: Client Services <clientservices@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: Client Feedback on Recent Product Launch\nAttachments: Client_Feedback_Report_September_2024.pdf\nCategories: Client Feedback\n\nDear Team,\n\nAttached you will find the client feedback report for our recent product launch. Please review and prepare any necessary response strategies for our meeting tomorrow.\n\nRegards,\nNancy\n\n--- On Mon, Sep 15, 2024 at 10:30 AM, Derek Lee <derek.lee@businessdomain.com> wrote:\nFrom: Derek Lee <derek.lee@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: RE: Client Feedback on Recent Product Launch\nTo: Nancy Reed <nancy.reed@businessdomain.com>\nCc: Client Services <clientservices@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Monday, September 15, 2024 10:30 AM\n\nNancy,\n\nThe feedback highlights several areas for improvement, especially in customer support during the launch phase. Should we schedule a separate session to address these concerns more thoroughly?\n\nBest,\nDerek\n\n--- On Mon, Sep 15, 2024 at 11:00 AM, Client Services <clientservices@businessdomain.com> wrote:\nFrom: Client Services <clientservices@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: RE: Client Feedback on Recent Product Launch\nTo: Derek Lee <derek.lee@businessdomain.com>, Nancy Reed <nancy.reed@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Monday, September 15, 2024 11:00 AM\n\nDerek, Nancy,\n\nAgreed. A focused discussion on enhancing our support framework would be beneficial. I’ve attached an initial proposal for improvements based on the feedback.\nAttachments: Support_Improvement_Proposal_2024.pdf\n\nRegards,\nBob Smithers\nClient Services Manager</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Processed Email:</b><br>from nancy reed sent monday september am to sales team sale cc client services clientservices subject client feedback recent product launch attachments categories client feedback dear team attached find client feedback report recent product launch please review prepare necessary response strategy meeting tomorrow regards nancy on mon sep am derek lee wrote from derek lee subject re client feedback recent product launch to nancy reed cc client services clientservices sent monday september am nancy the feedback highlight several area improvement especially customer support launch phase should schedule separate session address concern thoroughly best derek on mon sep am client services clientservices wrote from client services clientservices subject re client feedback recent product launch to derek lee nancy reed sent monday september am derek nancy agreed focused discussion enhancing support framework would beneficial attached initial proposal improvement based feedback attachments regards bob smithers client services manager</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </table>\n                    '}, 'metadata': {}}]}, 'buffer_paths': []}}, 'buffers': []})
