ect Management\n\nHello Team,\n\nPlease find attached the weekly status update for Project Alpha. Let’s ensure we address the pending issues listed in the document before our meeting on Wednesday.\n\nBest,\nJanet\n\n--- On Mon, Jun 23, 2024 at 10:00 AM, Mark Benson <mark.benson@businessdomain.com> wrote:\nFrom: Mark Benson <mark.benson@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: RE: Weekly Update on Project Alpha\nTo: Janet Kim <janet.kim@businessdomain.com>\nCc: Project Sponsor <sponsor@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Monday, June 23, 2024 10:00 AM\n\nJanet,\n\nThanks for the update. I’ve noticed a discrepancy in the budget allocations discussed. I’m looping in our project sponsor for clarity. Can we also discuss this in our call?\n\nCheers,\nMark</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Email Without Unwanted Texts:</b><br>From: Janet Kim <janet.kim@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Monday, June 23, 2024 8:15 AM\nTo: Project Team Alpha <project.alpha@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: Weekly Update on Project Alpha\nAttachments: Project_Alpha_Status_Update_06_23_2024.pdf\nCategories: Project Management\n\nHello Team,\n\nPlease find attached the weekly status update for Project Alpha. Let’s ensure we address the pending issues listed in the document before our meeting on Wednesday.\n\nBest,\nJanet\n\n--- On Mon, Jun 23, 2024 at 10:00 AM, Mark Benson <mark.benson@businessdomain.com> wrote:\nFrom: Mark Benson <mark.benson@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: RE: Weekly Update on Project Alpha\nTo: Janet Kim <janet.kim@businessdomain.com>\nCc: Project Sponsor <sponsor@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Monday, June 23, 2024 10:00 AM\n\nJanet,\n\nThanks for the update. I’ve noticed a discrepancy in the budget allocations discussed. I’m looping in our project sponsor for clarity. Can we also discuss this in our call?\n\nCheers,\nMark</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Processed Email:</b><br>from janet kim sent monday june am to project team alpha subject weekly update project alpha attachments categories project management hello team please find attached weekly status update project alpha let ensure address pending issue listed document meeting wednesday best janet on mon jun am mark benson wrote from mark benson subject re weekly update project alpha to janet kim cc project sponsor sponsor sent monday june am janet thanks update noticed discrepancy budget allocation discussed looping project sponsor clarity can also discus call cheers mark</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </table>\n                    '}, 'metadata': {}}]}, 'buffer_paths': []}}, 'buffers': []})
