s,\n\nAttached you will find the updated remote work policy that takes effect starting August 2024. Please ensure your team members are made aware and understand the changes.\n\nKind regards,\nAlice\n\n--- On Thu, Jul 10, 2024 at 9:30 AM, Emily Stone <emily.stone@businessdomain.com> wrote:\nFrom: Emily Stone <emily.stone@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: RE: Updated Remote Work Policy\nTo: Alice Hart <alice.hart@businessdomain.com>\nCc: HR Department <hr@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Thursday, July 10, 2024 9:30 AM\n\nAlice,\n\nThank you for the update. There seems to be a section that could contradict our compliance standards. Can we discuss this with the HR legal team before dissemination?\n\nBest,\nEmily</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Email Without Unwanted Texts:</b><br>From: Alice Hart <alice.hart@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Thursday, July 10, 2024 9:00 AM\nTo: All Managers <managers@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: Updated Remote Work Policy\nAttachments: Remote_Work_Policy_2024.pdf\nCategories: Human Resources\n\nDear Managers,\n\nAttached you will find the updated remote work policy that takes effect starting August 2024. Please ensure your team members are made aware and understand the changes.\n\nKind regards,\nAlice\n\n--- On Thu, Jul 10, 2024 at 9:30 AM, Emily Stone <emily.stone@businessdomain.com> wrote:\nFrom: Emily Stone <emily.stone@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: RE: Updated Remote Work Policy\nTo: Alice Hart <alice.hart@businessdomain.com>\nCc: HR Department <hr@businessdomain.com>\nSent: Thursday, July 10, 2024 9:30 AM\n\nAlice,\n\nThank you for the update. There seems to be a section that could contradict our compliance standards. Can we discuss this with the HR legal team before dissemination?\n\nBest,\nEmily</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Processed Email:</b><br>from alice hart sent thursday july am to all managers manager subject updated remote work policy attachments categories human resources dear managers attached find updated remote work policy take effect starting august please ensure team member made aware understand change kind regard alice on thu jul am emily stone wrote from emily stone subject re updated remote work policy to alice hart cc hr department hr sent thursday july am alice thank update there seems section could contradict compliance standard can discus hr legal team dissemination best emily</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </table>\n                    '}, 'metadata': {}}]}, 'buffer_paths': []}}, 'buffers': []})
