 the online portal. Despite resetting my password, I still cannot access my account. Could someone assist me with this issue?\n\nBest regards,\nJohn</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Email Without Unwanted Texts:</b><br>From:    John Smith <john.smith@example.com>\nSent:    Tuesday, May 27, 2024 10:30 AM\nTo:      Tech Support <techsupport@businessdomain.com>\nSubject: Trouble Logging into the Portal\n\nDear Support Team,\n\nI\'ve been having ongoing issues with logging into the online portal. Despite resetting my password, I still cannot access my account. Could someone assist me with this issue?\n\nBest regards,\nJohn</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Processed Email:</b><br>from john smith sent tuesday may am to tech support techsupport subject trouble logging portal dear support team ongoing issue logging online portal despite resetting password still access account could someone assist issue best regard john</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </table>\n                    '}, 'metadata': {}}]}, 'buffer_paths': []}}, 'buffers': []})
