nI\'ve noticed some irregularities in login attempts which seem to be unusually high. It might be related to the issue Emily reported. Has anyone else noticed this? Could this be a DDOS attack?\n\nRegards,\nJohn\n\n\n\n\n\n</td>\n                            <td class="email-view"><b>Processed Email:</b><br>from emily turner sent monday june am to it support itsupport cc john doe customer relations subject urgent hi team we received multiple report morning user experiencing login failure despite correct credential entered this issue seems escalating affecting customer can immediate check server log possibly escalate network team necessary we need swift resolution avoid customer dissatisfaction thanks emily on mon john doe wrote from john doe subject re login issue alert to it support itsupport sent sunday june pm noticed irregularity login attempt seem unusually high it might related issue emily reported has anyone else noticed could ddos attack regards john</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </table>\n                    '}, 'metadata': {}}]}, 'buffer_paths': []}}, 'buffers': []})
